11, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "breezys_way", "author_id": "318431018", "id": "18103146169502835", "text": "Just like your own car. Wipe steering wheel w a clorox wipe and see how much grim u have on ur own car", "timestamp": 1744509650, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "cheri.dane", "author_id": "59358241619", "id": "18033923012322186", "text": "C’est même propre", "timestamp": 1744476532, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "poochiez_1990", "author_id": "24808523665", "id": "18000363500768232", "text": "Seria bueno si cambiara de toallita viene siendo lo mismo los germenes estan ay", "timestamp": 1744243240, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "carmenblaauw__", "author_id": "198537594", "id": "18059949899288617", "text": "@blaauww__ 🤢", "timestamp": 1744229087, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "reemabegum2001", "author_id": "73357489577", "id": "18058107314155912", "text": "That is so disgusting", "timestamp": 1744152710, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "norimitsu3diego", "author_id": "3316540448", "id": "18459229012079155", "text": "but we only touch one point of the belt, we don't drag our hands like that", "timestamp": 1744136836, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "photobafer", "author_id": "70812728519", "id": "18044166227144377", "text": "Cuanto tiempo libre", "timestamp": 1744104281, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "miyut58462021", "author_id": "48671069718", "id": "17918012535084977", "text": "センメルヴェイスに心から感謝👏🥲", "timestamp": 1744089805, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "bryan_from_foton", "author_id": "70965726142", "id": "18085332577627896", "text": "Tbh, who thought something in public was clean to touch and not wash hands.", "timestamp": 1744028665, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tgobles.art", "author_id": "10425805823", "id": "18052100306336101", "text": "If they were going for sanitary, they should have used multiple wipes to clean that. It was basically dry by the time the sticker came back around.", "timestamp": 1743999736, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sarahjobst90", "author_id": "2365850668", "id": "18350927344148440", "text": "Und wenn du mehr als nur ein Tuch benutzt hättest, wär es wenigstens wirklich sauber geworden. So hat man es wieder nur hinter her gezogen 😂", "timestamp": 1743933870, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "carlitos_memphis90", "author_id": "59688187004", "id": "17854169394415164", "text": "Das war doch vorher schon dreckig 😅👌", "timestamp": 1743926962, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "smokeyhunter76", "author_id": "41134996361", "id": "18046555634375435", "text": "Probably the grease used to make that belt move smoothly.", "timestamp": 1743882764, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "khunsiilukhuun", "author_id": "72916648848", "id": "18119144230447463", "text": "😢", "timestamp": 1743854028, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/5.min.crafts/reel/DH85VI2IQY6/", "webpage_url_basename": "DH85VI2IQY6", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/503387147_719545207283061_308840967008447488_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=MzYwMjAwNTk0MzI0Nzc2NzA5OA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjYxMi5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=K7y_6_q8E6oQ7kNvwHtKoc2&_nc_oc=Ado3Me_LUejLly3qO7R42ilNHmCojEtH0s8GyFZ6a2HkwE-SGuXx9NZzX1c33a-pH6w&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=YlTK41VC3X0WP3Xz4Xt9Xg&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQLVRYA8dAogku97VcropCgvXn1eRmGY-J1nvqKepW96tg&oe=6AA512DC", "display_id": "DH85VI2IQY6", "fulltitle": "Video by 5.min.crafts", "upload_date": "20250402", "epoch": 1788820506, "format": "dash-1046585811245664v - 716x1274 (DASH video)+dash-992463399696902a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-1046585811245664v+dash-992463399696902a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 1908.231, "width": 716, "height": 1274, "resolution": "716x1274", "dynamic_rang